{"id": 82657, "field": "description", "ja": "Wild Leatherのベストは、Wild Leather防具一式の要だ。ベストの骨組みがwildvineと溶け合い、胴体を最大限に守りつつ、強力な魔力が衣服全体に行き渡る品が出来上がるんだ。\n\nこの型紙には、Turtle Scale breastplatesを2つ、Turtle Scale glovesを2組、それにwildvineを一つ用意してもらう。大変な注文だけど、君ならほとんど苦労せずに揃えられるはずだ。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names", "numbers", "length"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-truncated-quest-description-sg9@2026-09-23", "imported": "2026-09-23"}, "english": {"hash": "cfbb37a9903c2981", "src": "wdb@1.15.9.69722"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
